[36m(TaskRunner pid=4019687)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=4019687)[0m The key insight here is that for each move, Sergey can narrow down the possible values of \( N \) by using the information from the set \( S \). Specifically, for each move, Sergey can determine which of the \( a_k \) values are included in the set \( \{a_k : k \in S\} \). By carefully choosing the sets \( S \), Sergey can isolate the value of \( N \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=4019687)[0m 
